---
title: Setup · when checks run
---
flowchart TD
  L([Launch]) --> R["Fresh checks<br/>(read-only, off the UI thread)"]
  R --> Q{"Something<br/>needs attention?"}
  Q -->|no| P([Projects])
  Q -->|"yes, user not navigated"| S["Set up Hack:<br/>ordered cards"]
  Q -->|"yes, user navigated"| P
  P -->|Run setup again| S
  S -->|Run| F["Fixed daemon start<br/>or install"]
  F --> R
  S -->|Admin step| T["Own terminal:<br/>shows command, waits Enter"]
  T -->|window regains focus| R
  S -->|Check again| R
  S -->|"shown 10 min, visible"| R
  S -->|CLI switched| R
  S -. Skip, this session .-> S
  S -->|"Continue (CLI ready)"| P
  classDef wait stroke-dasharray:2 2
  classDef ok stroke-width:1.6px
  class T wait
  class P ok
